== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
From {{term|verða||to [[need]]|lang=is}} + {{term|að|lang=is}} {{term|fara||to [[go]]|lang=is}} + {{term|núna||[[now]]|lang=is}}. Literally meaning "to need to leave now".

=== Phrase ===
'''[[verða#Icelandic|verða]] [[að#Icelandic|að]] [[fara#Icelandic|fara]] [[núna]]'''

# to [[have]] to go, to [[need]] to leave now, to need to go now
#: ''[[fyrirgefðu|Fyrirgefðu]], ég '''verð að fara núna'''.''
#:: I'm [[sorry]], I '''need to go now'''.

